{#- modules/agents/good-fast-cheap.j2
    The framing pair for the whole talk: the classic delivery triangle,
    then the same triangle under an agent loop.

    The second slide never says "you get all three" out loud. It shows the
    whole triangle lit and names the loop; the claim is the picture. Saying
    it in words turns an argument the audience makes for themselves into a
    boast they can dismiss.

    Written against the brand-pack primitive contract (see AGENTS.md): no hex
    colors, no brand class names. Import WITH CONTEXT:

      {%- from "modules/agents/good-fast-cheap.j2" import
          pick_two, agent_loops with context %}
-#}

{%- from "modules/branding/" ~ branding ~ "/primitives.j2" import
    content_slide,
    slide_heading,
    tradeoff_triangle,
    statement
-%}


{%- macro pick_two() -%}
{#- Deliberately bare — no heading at all. Everyone in the room already
    knows this triangle; the slide's whole job is to put it on the wall so
    the next one can move it. Any words here are filler. -#}
{%- call content_slide("Pick two") %}
  {{ tradeoff_triangle([
    {"label": "Good",  "accent": "primary"},
    {"label": "Cheap", "accent": "warning"},
    {"label": "Fast",  "accent": "info"},
  ], note="pick two") }}
{%- endcall %}
{%- endmacro -%}


{%- macro agent_loops() -%}
{#- The same triangle, filled. Nothing explains it: the shape changing
    between the two slides is the whole argument, and the audience closes
    it themselves. -#}
{%- call content_slide("Agents and Validators") %}
  {{ slide_heading("", "Agents &amp; Validators") }}
  {{ tradeoff_triangle([
    {"label": "Good",  "accent": "success"},
    {"label": "Cheap", "accent": "success"},
    {"label": "Fast",  "accent": "success"},
  ], filled=true) }}
{%- endcall %}
{%- endmacro -%}


{%- macro loops_require_verifiers() -%}
{#- The thesis, stated flat. The triangle slide deliberately never claims
    "all three"; this does not claim it either. It names the condition the
    rest of the talk spends its time on. -#}
{{ statement([
  {"text": "Agent Loops"},
  {"text": "require", "muted": true},
  {"text": "Verifiers"},
]) }}
{%- endmacro -%}
